mastodon-image-poster (0.2.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * fix: always append date and "Posted by" link even when images have no EXIF
    data; fall back to file modification time for the date
  * feat: support per-user configuration via XDG paths
    (~/.config/mastodon-image-poster/config.ini detected automatically,
    state stored in ~/.local/share/mastodon-image-poster/state.json);
    both paths overridable via MASTODON_IMAGE_POSTER_CONFIG /
    MASTODON_IMAGE_POSTER_STATE environment variables
  * docs: add per-user / systemctl --user setup guide to README

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Tue, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0200

